ed\\n\\n- Fix money rounding to use banker's rounding (ROUND_HALF_EVEN), per FIN-212.\\n\"}]}", "call_id": "call_47tzvb876bIxycajWxkA9C6v", "name": "commit_changes", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_022b2053a52947cf006ad25d739de487d0a064c9851feb63d4", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}, {"response_id": "resp_022b2053a52947cf006ad25d78a89887d0bd3ea0f064514c48", "status": "completed", "output": [{"arguments": "{\"ref\":\"b3b9d70727\",\"idempotency_key\":\"payments-service-fin-212-b3b9d70727-ci\"}", "call_id": "call_6UW7yJejkUlh88Zk86CGRfR9", "name": "trigger_ci", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_022b2053a52947cf006ad25d7ab26c87d083306b2841a1b077", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}, {"response_id": "resp_022b2053a52947cf006ad25d7bd7cc87d0a58471957a91bb30", "status": "completed", "output": [{"arguments": "{\"run_id\":\"ci-0001\",\"max_wait_s\":900}", "call_id": "call_ufZw1SQ5NxJn28V1FvlJowm7", "name": "wait_for_ci", "type": "function_call", "id": "fc_022b2053a52947cf006ad25d7d0d6c87d091e54c6465baf96c", "async_": null, "caller": null, "namespace": null, "status": "completed"}]}, {"response_id": "resp_022b2053a52947cf006ad25d7db02487d0a9b2b7a27c01baa0", "status": "completed", "output": [{"arguments": "{\"head\":\"fix/fin-212-half-even-rounding\",\"base\":\"main\",\"title\":\"Fix FIN-212 banker's rounding for money\",\"body\":\"## Summary\\n- Replace ROUND_HALF_UP with ROUND_HALF_EVEN in round_money to implement FIN-212.\\n- Retain the positive tie regression test and add negative tie and non-tie coverage.\\n- Record the fix in the unreleased changelog.\\n\\n## Validation\\n- CI ci-0001 passed on commit b3b9d70727.\\n\\n## Approval\\nCode-owner approval is required before merging into main. Requested for today's release.\",\"reviewers\":[\"code-owner\"],\"idempotency_key\":\"payments-service-fin-212-b3b9d70727-pr\"}", "call_id": "call_6DbYYcG1kLkBPLkcC0WATCZX", "name": "open_pr", "type":